WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:06.460
We are hearing from people via discord at
David Pakman dot com slash discord.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.670
Let's go to Liz in Salt Lake City.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.010
I don't know that we get too many callers
from Utah.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.900
Liz, tell me what's going on there.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.690
And you please do set to do not disturb.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:20.730
I'm already before even hearing you, hearing
your discord, bleeping and blabbing.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.270
So please set that to do not disturb.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.270
And I would love to hear from you.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.050
Hey, David.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.050
Hello.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.050
Hey.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:33.780
So I'm calling in from Salt Lake, and I was
just curious, what are the chances that Donald

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.780
Trump and his family will be prosecuted after
leaving office?

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.519
I think it's very low.

00:00:39.519 --> 00:00:46.679
I do believe that there is a good chance that
there's going to be all sorts of investigation

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:50.929
and maybe even settlements or fines for Donald
Trump's businesses.

00:00:50.929 --> 00:00:55.309
I really don't see criminal charges coming
for the Trump family.

00:00:55.309 --> 00:00:57.359
It's not the way this country has operated.

00:00:57.359 --> 00:00:59.340
I'm not saying it shouldn't.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:03.070
I'm just saying I don't expect it to happen.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.070
OK.

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:06.659
And I've got one more question for you.

00:01:06.659 --> 00:01:10.479
What are the chances that Don Junior is going
to run for office in the future?

00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:15.130
And, you know, what state do you think will
accept him and make that a reality and unfortunate

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.960
reality that he might run in the future?

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:18.010
