00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.110
What state will accept him?

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:22.960
Like, where does he have a chance of running?

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:27.439
Will he get like a second home and become
a resident of, like, Alabama or something?

00:01:27.439 --> 00:01:31.399
You're saying he's good, but would he be running
for president or for Senate?

00:01:31.399 --> 00:01:38.189
Senate maybe like a governor working his way
to the White House or ambitious especially?

00:01:38.189 --> 00:01:39.259
Oh, he does.

00:01:39.259 --> 00:01:41.649
Is speech just how he supports his dad?

00:01:41.649 --> 00:01:44.180
So I was just curious, like, who will accept
him?

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.450
Do you think he has a future in politics?

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:47.450
I don't see it.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:48.819
But I you know, I think he's pretty self-serving.

00:01:48.819 --> 00:01:53.299
