as well.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.069
And we've got to make sure we don't we don't
make that any easier for them.

00:02:28.069 --> 00:02:29.180
Telo.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.290
OK.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.510
